@Brneyedgrrl
meaning of PUZZLE is: to offer or represent to (someone) a problem difficult to solve or a situation difficult to resolve : challenge mentally; also : to exert (oneself, one's mind, etc.) over such a problem or situation. To perplex. An enigma.
There you go, that’s what it was trying to accomplish. If it was too tough for you…that’s not the fault of the puzzle.

